EwmhBaseStruts screen $[monitor.primary] 0 192 0 0

DestroyFunc IconManClick
AddToFunc IconManClick
+ I ThisWindow (Raised, Focused, !Iconic, CurrentPage) Iconify
+ I TestRc (Match) Break
+ I ThisWindow Raise
+ I ThisWindow (Iconic) Iconify
+ I ThisWindow (AcceptsFocus) FlipFocus

Style FvwmPanel !Title, !Borders, !Handles, Sticky, \
                WindowListSkip, NeverFocus

Style FvwmIconMan !Title, !Borders, !Handles, Sticky, \
                  WindowListSkip, NeverFocus

Style FvwmCatclock !Title, !Borders, !Handles, Sticky, \
                   WindowListSkip, NeverFocus, StaysOnBottom

Colorset 11 bg white
Colorset 22 fg white, bg #891446

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmPanel: *
*FvwmPanel: Colorset 1
*FvwmPanel: Font "xft:SFProText:size=12"
*FvwmPanel: Frame 0
*FvwmPanel: Geometry 192x173-0+0
*FvwmPanel: Columns 192
*FvwmPanel: Rows 173

*FvwmPanel: (192x32, ActiveColorset 2, PressColorset 2, \
             Padding 0 0, Icon haikustart.png, \
             Action(Mouse 1) Menu rootmenu Root o100-176p 16p, \
             Action(Mouse 3) Exec exec $[infostore.runcmd])

*FvwmPanel: (192x1, Colorset 11)

*FvwmPanel: (128x32, Colorset 2, Padding 8 4, Left, Swallow(NoClose, UseOld) \
             stalonetray 'Exec exec stalonetray -c $HOME/.fvwm/stalonetrayrc')
*FvwmPanel: (64x32, Colorset 2, id "FvwmClock", Padding 8 4, Title (Right) "clock")

*FvwmPanel: (192x1, Colorset 11)
*FvwmPanel: (1x106, Colorset 11)
*FvwmPanel: (190x106, Swallow FvwmPager 'Module FvwmPager *')
*FvwmPanel: (1x106, Colorset 11)
*FvwmPanel: (192x1, Colorset 11)

PipeRead 'echo "SendToModule FvwmButtons ChangeButton \
FvwmClock Title \"`date +%I:%M`\""'

Schedule Periodic 10000 PipeRead 'echo "SendToModule \
FvwmButtons ChangeButton FvwmClock Title \"`date +%I:%M`\""'

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmPager: *
*FvwmPager: Colorset * 22
*FvwmPager: WindowColorsets 3 4
*FvwmPager: Font None
*FvwmPager: NoDeskHilight
*FvwmPager: SloppyFocus
#*FvwmPager: UseSkipList
*FvwmPager: Window3DBorders

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmIconMan: *
*FvwmIconMan: Resolution global
*FvwmIconMan: UseWinList true
*FvwmIconMan: FollowFocus true

*FvwmIconMan: Font "xft:SFProText:size=12"
*FvwmIconMan: ButtonGeometry 192x32
*FvwmIconMan: ManagerGeometry 1x0-0+173

*FvwmIconMan: DrawIcons never
*FvwmIconMan: ReliefThickness 0
*FvwmIconMan: Format "%t"

*FvwmIconMan: ShowOnlyIcons false
*FvwmIconMan: Tips never

*FvwmIconMan: Colorset 0
*FvwmIconMan: PlainColorset 1
*FvwmIconMan: IconColorset 1
*FvwmIconMan: FocusColorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: SelectColorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: IconAndSelectColorset 2
*FvwmIconMan: FocusAndSelectColorset 2

*FvwmIconMan: Sort weighted
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 10 class=firefox
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 15 class=feishin
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 20 class=discord title=*Discord
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 20 class=vesktop title=Discord*
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 25 class=discord
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 25 class=vesktop
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 30 class=steam title=Steam
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 35 class=steam
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 40 class=org.nicotine_plus.Nicotine
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 45 class=qBittorrent
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 55 class=Alacritty
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 65 class=Thunar
*FvwmIconMan: SortWeight 100 # everything else trailing

*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 0 N sendcommand Nop
*FvwmIconMan: Action Mouse 1 A sendcommand IconManClick

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmCatclock: *
*FvwmCatclock: Colorset 22
*FvwmCatclock: Frame 0
*FvwmCatclock: Geometry 192x300-0-0
*FvwmCatclock: Columns 1
*FvwmCatclock: Rows 1

*FvwmCatclock: (1x1, Swallow(NoClose, UseOld) Catclock 'Exec exec xclock -background "#891446"')

DestroyFunc StartFunction
AddToFunc   StartFunction
+ I Module FvwmButtons FvwmPanel
+ I Module FvwmIconMan
+ I Module FvwmButtons FvwmCatclock